# Company comparison — legal note

Any chart or table that names competing funeral homes, cemeteries, or insurance companies, or that republishes their prices or ratings side by side, must have a **comparison notice** directly under it.

Use `lib/company-compare-disclaimer.js`:

- Funeral-home GPL / package columns → `funeralHomeCompareNote(lang)`
- Appointed-carrier list or scores → `appointedCarrierCompareNote(lang)`
- Third-party funeral averages (Funeralocity, NFDA) → `thirdPartyFuneralAverageNote(lang)`

Do not invent a shorter substitute. Keep ES and EN. Source dates stay on the line above the notice.
